          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;-- that i'd end up with scars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;aka&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;the one where adora goes away to college, leaving catra stuck in their desolate hometown. they meet at a party a year later, and it goes about as expected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;(title is taken from "scars" by the crane wives)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
